offset_top = 72.0
offset_right = 670.0
offset_bottom = 542.0
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
autowrap_mode = 3
text = "Evil cells have broken through a wound in the skin and are advancing down each vessel toward your body's Core.

If a hostile cell reaches the Core, your Body Health drops. If Body Health runs out, you lose.

Your job: place immune cells into open slots along the vessels to intercept and destroy the invaders before they get through.

• Select a defender below, then click an open slot to place it.
• Each defender costs Recruitment Points (RP), which regenerate over time.
• Hover over a defender's button to see its stats and ability.
• Support cells don't attack, but combine with your attackers: Helper T boosts a neighbor's power, Dendritic marks enemies to take extra damage from everyone, Mast Cell slows anything nearby.

Survive every wave before the timer runs out to clear the level."

